{"surah":113,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"arabic":"قُلۡ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلۡفَلَقِ","translit":"Qul aAAoothu birabbi alfalaqi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak"}},{"n":2,"arabic":"مِن شَرِّ مَا خَلَقَ","translit":"Min sharri ma khalaqa","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"From the evil of that which He created"}},{"n":3,"arabic":"وَمِن شَرِّ غَاسِقٍ إِذَا وَقَبَ","translit":"Wamin sharri ghasiqin itha waqaba","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And from the evil of darkness when it settles"}},{"n":4,"arabic":"وَمِن شَرِّ ٱلنَّفَّٰثَٰتِ فِي ٱلۡعُقَدِ","translit":"Wamin sharri alnnaffathati fee alAAuqadi","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And from the evil of the blowers in knots"}},{"n":5,"arabic":"وَمِن شَرِّ حَاسِدٍ إِذَا حَسَدَ","translit":"Wamin sharri hasidin itha hasada","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And from the evil of an envier when he envies"}}]}